  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nThe simplified value of 74 - 3 × (21 + 15) + 36\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n74 - 3 × (21 + 15) + 36\n\n⇒ 74 - 3 × (36) + 36\n\n⇒ 74 - 108 + 36\n\n⇒ (74 + 36) - 108\n\n⇒ 110 - 108\n\n⇒ 2\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (1).**",
